  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to OSCE</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to OSCE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser st&#xf6;d till OSCE:s &#xf6;vervakning av kommande presidentval i Ukraina (okt 2004). Insatsen kommer att koordineras av OSCEs kontor i Kiev. Sida har genomf&#xf6;rt ett fact-finding mission som visar att svenskt st&#xf6;d passar de aktiviteter som planeras.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish contribution concerns support to OSCE&apos;s monitoring of the upcoming presidential elections in the Ukraine. The contribution will be coordinated by OSCE&apos;s office in Kiev. Sida has conducted a fact-finding mission, which indicates that a Swedish contribution can fit the proposed activities.</narrative>
  </description>
